                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Matus to Mr.
                            Guzman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Translation—Handed to the Secretary of
                        State by the Nicaraguan minister, April 23, 1895.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-04-22"><hi rendition="#italic">April 22,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>English war vessels are here to enforce the ultimatum. We have asked Lord
                    Kimberley by cable to await the instructions sent to our representative in
                    London for an amicable settlement of the difficulty. We are expecting his reply.
                    Request the Government of the United States to aid Nicaragua in obtaining
                    that.</p>
            </div>
